WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,840
I can't figure it out by myself.

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:04,700
You need to find someone knowledgeable

3
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:09,810
Then you have to go find Xu Qing. I told you

4
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:11,210
He is a tutor in the Department of Medicine

5
00:00:11,490 --> 00:00:13,250
Joint master's and doctoral studies, specializing in "advancing"

6
00:00:13,690 --> 00:00:15,130
What's going on with this mourner?

7
00:00:15,290 --> 00:00:16,690
He knows more than both of us combined

8
00:00:16,930 --> 00:00:18,850
Then this trip happens to be two things done at the same time.

9
00:00:18,850 --> 00:00:20,050
Pick up this old classmate of yours

10
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:22,090
By the way, let him show the mourner where he is.

11
00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:23,970
The relationship between classmates for four years was not bad.

12
00:00:24,090 --> 00:00:25,690
He usually works at the medical school

13
00:00:25,770 --> 00:00:27,530
Either teaching building or dormitory

14
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:29,650
I wish I was still alive at this time

15
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:30,930
Go to the medical school teaching building first

16
00:00:31,090 --> 00:00:32,730
On the way, I passed the Art Building and took a look.

17
00:00:34,980 --> 00:00:35,900
Why so many

18
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:38,440
There is a big class here before the end

19
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:41,120
I heard it was an art assessment

20
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:43,700
A whole floor of people are stuck here.

21
00:00:44,390 --> 00:00:45,790
That's like bringing the whole country here.

22
00:00:45,910 --> 00:00:47,710
There is no value in this building.

23
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:50,960
Investigate the school art area
